  "audit_selection": {
    "initial_free_text_need": "Request up to two frozen audit items: a same-customer multi-subscription reconciliation run showing authoritative Billing API state/billing-period boundaries and identity keys distinguishing subscription plus billing period; and an API retry/idempotency audit item for duplicate/timeout/resume behavior showing snapshots are not silently substituted for Billing API authority and settlement effects remain idempotent.",
