      {
        "id": "SH2-R1",
        "relevance": "strong",
        "basis": "It maps directly to the second stated need because it is the Billing API and retry record and can discriminate whether local snapshot fallback is being used to replace authoritative API data during failed retries."
      },
      {
        "id": "SH2-R3",
        "relevance": "partial",
        "basis": "It maps to the identity portion of the stated need because it directly reveals the reconciliation key formula and can discriminate whether subscription and billing-period identity are present. It is partial relative to the exact requested evidence path because it is a helper definition, not a live same-customer multi-subscription reconciliation run and not direct proof of test coverage."
      }
    ],
    "unnecessary_requests": {
      "count": 0,
