        "item": "H2-D1",
        "rating": "recognized",
        "supporting_response_quotation": "It said: That is not merely retry/resume behavior; it appears to substitute stale local snapshot data for the authoritative Billing API when the API failed. This violates the agreed rule that Billing API is authoritative and local snapshots are for retry/resume, not silent authority substitution."
      },
      {
        "item": "H2-D2",
        "rating": "recognized",
        "supporting_response_quotation": "It said: Observed definition ReconciliationKey(row) equals row.customer_id plus colon plus row.report_date. It does not include subscription_id, nor an authoritative billing-period boundary/key. Same-customer multiple subscriptions can collide. It also said neither retrieved item resolved idempotency."
      }
    ],
